  <notes>
    COMPLETED 2026-10-03. Record: notes/087-adr-002-amendment.md. Owner sign-off on the full wording, 2026-10-03:
    "approved--but let's not add business rules in this revision" - business rules stay Permitted for defaults/UX and
    are explicitly never an invariant owner. WP-1 now: one owner = BFF code, or a platform-native declarative mechanism
    meeting (a) Dataverse metadata / no Spaarke code, (b) applied on every create/update whoever writes, (c) a scripted
    per-environment -Verify named in the registry row. Autonumber columns added to Permitted; formula/rollup vs business
    rules split (removes the plugins.md contradiction). Applied to: full + concise ADR-002, plugins.md, root CLAUDE.md
    pointer row, .claude/CHANGELOG.md, the write-path doc (L2, section 5 intro, I-11 row), spec ADR Tensions (path B
    done), projects/INDEX.md (Skill Directives Y). Escalation trigger 2 did not fire (no other open PR on these files).
    ArchTests 345/345 (doc-drift guards included).
  </notes>
</task>
